ل ناديا حارة الضبع وسط أنظار واستغراب أهل الحارة ورجالها المحافظين كي تطمئن على أبي عصام، فتتردد الأقاويل في أروقة الحارة حول علاقته بها، ترى كيف سيواجه أبو عصام الشائعات وكيف سيفسر ظهور ناديا في حياته بشكل مفاجئ؟ وما السر وراء تلك الشخصية؟","description_en":"A modern classic of Arab television. A social drama set in the 1920s in Damascus- It highlights Damascene life, noble values, and ancient customs and traditions represented by the people of Harat al-Dabeh who fled to Harat al-Salihiyah after the French bombed Harat al-Dabeh. The events take place after the gold is stolen from the house of the cloth merchant Abu Ibrahim, and the guard Abu al-Samu is killed. The men of the neighborhood try to find the thief.","description_fr":"","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjnLbyDWHadRp2vuEejTKJ1AxWz.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nXnL3OwMB1RNPG7pAl3GgWLXRKP.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":7.4,"vote_count":15,"age_rating":null,"year":"2006","release_date":"2006-09-23","runtime_minutes":null,"status":"Ended","country":"سوريا","language":"العربية","genres":["دراما","إجتماعي","بيئة شامية","اجتماعي"],"genre_keys":["drama"],"similar":["tv247718","tv259909","tv2288","tv4607","tv90","tv97951","tv80748","tv231503"],"director":null,"cast":[],"trailer_url":null,"seasons_count":13,"episodes_count":402,"all_airings":[{"channel_id":"BabAlHara.sa@SD","start":"2026-11-17T23:30:49Z","stop":"2026-11-18T00:16:08Z","start_ts":1794958249,"stop_ts":1794960968,"season":6,"episode":16},{"channel_id":"BabAlHara.sa@SD","start":"2026-11-18T00:16:08Z","stop":"2026-11-18T00:53:59Z","start_ts":1794960968,"stop_ts":1794963239,"season":6,"episode":17},{"channel_id":"BabAlHara.sa@SD","start":"2026-11-18T00:53:59Z","stop":"2026-11-18T01:42:42Z","start_ts":1794963239,"stop_ts":1794966162,"season":6,"episode":18},{"channel_id":"MBCDrama.ae@SD","start":"2026-11-18T01:00:00Z","stop":"2026-11-18T02:00:00Z","start_ts":1794963600,"stop_ts":1794967200,"season":6,"episode":22},{"channel_id